<p><a href="https://jessehoward.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://jessehoward.net/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1697285064845000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2DqH6vnfzuZfE8MApjzUqi">https://jessehoward.net/</a></p>
